+ * @file http_pages.c
+ * @brief HTML page content — all pages const in ROM
+ *
+ * Total ~3 KB. Minified inline CSS. No JS frameworks.
+ * Template markers: {{SSID}}, {{IP}}, {{MASK}}, {{GW}}, {{DNS}},
+ * {{SERVER}}, {{MAC}}, {{VER}}, {{DHCP}}, {{CRYPT}}, {{PROXY}}.
