+/**
+ * @brief AES Key Unwrap (RFC 3394) for WPA2 EAPOL key data decryption
+ *
+ * Input:  wrapped data of (n+1)*8 bytes, where n >= 2
+ * Output: unwrapped data of n*8 bytes
+ *
+ * The 'length' parameter is the length of the WRAPPED input data.
+ * Output receives length-8 bytes.
+ *
+ * For WPA2 GTK: typically length=32 (wrapped), output=24 bytes (KDE+GTK)
+ *
+ * @param [in]  aes     AES context (initialized with KEK)
+ * @param [out] out     Output buffer (at least length-8 bytes)
+ * @param [in]  in      Wrapped input data
+ * @param [in]  length  Length of wrapped input (must be multiple of 8, >= 24)
+ */
